        "answer": {
          "short": "A: $(28\\times20)-(6\\times6)$.",
          "worked": "Subtract the area of the cut-out square from the area of the rectangle.\n$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{rectangle}}&=28\\times20\\\\A_{\\text{rectangle}}&=560\\ \\text{cm}^2\\\\A_{\\text{square}}&=6\\times6\\\\A_{\\text{square}}&=36\\ \\text{cm}^2\\\\A_{\\text{remaining}}&=560-36\\\\A_{\\text{remaining}}&=524\\ \\text{cm}^2\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: A.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
